  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模組。滿懷愛心製作。大量適用於 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"關於本模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p>草籽是一款極簡風格的模組，讓玩家可以透過對著泥土方塊使用普通種子，將其轉變為草地；此外，還能對著草地方塊放置高草。</p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依賴項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"包含於 The Vanilla Experience 模組包\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-extra-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/extra-bundle.svg&w=700\" alt=\"包含於 Serilum 的額外組合包\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"執行環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示區\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>就是這麼簡單：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示隱藏內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/grass-seeds/a.webp\" alt=\"功能展示\" width=\"848\" height=\"472\"></p>\n</details>\n<p><br><span><strong>1.1 版本新增功能：玩家還可以在草地上種植草與高草：</strong><br></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示隱藏內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/grass-seeds/b.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"844\" height=\"474\"></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>只要下載來源仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 平台內，您可以在任何模組包中自由使用此模組。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 包含所有模組的概覽與更多資訊。</span><br><span><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，歡迎前往 <a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">Github 倉庫</a>。感謝您！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
